From: INMYS <support@inmys.ru>
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: display: adv7511: describe sync-from-de

Allow parallel-video boards with unusable separate sync signals to
request HSYNC/VSYNC reconstruction from external DE and mode timings.

Signed-off-by: INMYS <support@inmys.ru>
---
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/bridge/adi,adv7511.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/bridge/adi,adv7511.yaml
@@ -110,6 +110,14 @@
       format tables in the datasheet.
     $ref: /schemas/types.yaml#/definitions/uint32
     enum: [ 1, 2, 3 ]
+
+  adi,sync-from-de:
+    description: |
+      Reconstruct HSYNC and VSYNC from external DE using the sync adjustment
+      generator and the selected display mode. Use when the separate sync
+      inputs are unavailable or incorrectly wired. Only progressive parallel
+      video with external DE is supported; do not combine with embedded sync.
+    type: boolean
 
   adi,input-justification:
     description: Input bit justification.
